      "content": "but everything feels so circular. just more walking, more fog, more waiting for something that never comes. it's like... if a poem ends, it's a beautiful thing. there's a sense of completion. but here, it just feels like i'm being forced to keep writing pages that don't even make sense anymore. why is it so wrong to want the story to reach its natural conclusion?",
